codex
I found the precise infrastructure defect: this sandbox gives Lean a PID-namespace-local `getpid()`, while `/proc` exposes different PIDs. Lean 4.22 resolves its executable through `/proc/<getpid>/exe`, so the lookup fails even though `/proc/self/exe` works. I’m applying a narrow, auditable preload shim that changes only that one `readlink` path to `/proc/self/exe`; the Lean binaries and project remain unchanged.
apply patch
patch: completed
/audit-output/evidence/procself_readlink.c
